{"sectionId":"renal/nephron","items":[{"id":"renal--nephron-k001","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"사구체 여과 장벽은 유창 내피, 기저막, podocyte slit diaphragm으로 구성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k002","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"GFR은 여과계수와 순여과압의 곱으로 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k003","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"청소율 Cx=UxV/Px이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k004","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"이눌린은 자유 여과되고 재흡수·분비되지 않아 GFR의 기준이 된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k005","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"creatinine은 일부 분비되어 GFR을 과대평가할 수 있으며 PAH는 낮은 농도에서 여과와 분비로 유효 신혈장류량 추정에 사용된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k006","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"배설량=여과량−재흡수량+분비량이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k007","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"근위세뇨관은 Na⁺, 물, bicarbonate 및 정상 농도의 포도당·아미노산 대부분을 재흡수한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k008","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"하행 헨레고리는 물 투과성이 크고 굵은 상행각은 NKCC2로 염을 재흡수하며 물 투과성이 낮다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k009","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"원위세뇨관의 NCC는 NaCl 수송, 집합관 principal cell의 ENaC와 ROMK는 Na⁺ 재흡수와 K⁺ 분비에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k010","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"intercalated cell은 산염기 균형에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k011","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"역류증폭과 vasa recta 교환은 수질 삼투기울기를 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k012","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"C_inulin=GFR; C_PAH≈유효 신혈장류량(조건 충족 시).","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k013","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"여과분율=GFR/RPF.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k014","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"상행 굵은각은 희석분절이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k015","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"Tm은 운반체 포화와 관련된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"renal--nephron-k016","sectionId":"renal/nephron","unitId":"renal","subject":"biology","text":"자유 여과를 가정하면 순재흡수 또는 여과 제한 등 가능성을 고려한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}